# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your real values.
# .env.local is already gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# The Supabase vars below are not required to run the app —
# src/lib/supabase.ts already has this project's real Supabase URL and
# publishable key baked in as defaults, and recipe generation / Toquee's
# chat run entirely client-side (see README.md "AI features"). Only set
# these to point a local checkout at a *different* Supabase project.

# From Supabase project settings -> API. Both are safe to expose to the
# browser (NEXT_PUBLIC_) — the publishable/anon key only has whatever access
# your Row Level Security policies grant it. See README.md for the "leads"
# table SQL.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Server-only. Powers Toquee's real-time scraping / grocery-list extraction
# via the Nimble API (src/lib/scrapeRecipeAction.ts, a Server Action).
# Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
NIMBLE_API_KEY=your-nimble-api-key-here

# Server-only. Fetches a real, verified photo for AI Recipe Helper results
# via src/lib/unsplash.ts. Only the Access Key is used (Client-ID auth on
# Unsplash's read-only search API); the Secret Key isn't needed for this.
# Never prefix either with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=your-unsplash-access-key-here
UNSPLASH_SECRET_KEY=your-unsplash-secret-key-here
